Z||000000||Voyd||12-07-1999||07:51 AM||||ok, i know this isnt exactly on topic here, but i was wondering if there exists a VIN decoder online for Chrylser vehicles. i tried a supposed GM decoder but it couldnt give me anything. we got a LeBaron here and it would be cool to see the vin info. thanks.||||reg||1
Z||000001||DJRice||12-07-1999||08:46 AM||||I dont know about online, but after I bought my Jeep back in August, I took the VIN up to my local Chrysler Dealership and they checked the recall history (none needed) and gave me a printout of all of the factory installed options.  <P>There also should be a chart in the front of a haynes manual if you can find an open one (for that model) in your local auto parts store. <p>[This message has been edited by DJRice (edited 12-07-1999).]||||reg||1
